{"title":"개나리가 떨어진 길 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"산속에 숨어 살고 있던 벼루는 개나리 아래에서 알을 줍게 되는데,\n머지않아 그 알에서는 용이 태어난다.\n갑자기 육아를 하게 된 벼루는 용에게 신리라는 이름을 지어준다.\n\n그런데 갓 태어난 신리는 놀라운 속도로 자라더니 어느새 벼루보다 커버리고,\n벼루는 그런 신리가 점점 신경 쓰인다.\n\n그러던 어느 날 벼루는 신리에게 역으로 잡아 먹히고 마는데…?\n\n\"아무리 핥고 빨아도 부족해.\n짙은 단내가 날 때마다 벼루를 먹고 싶어.\"","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-11-04","rank":26,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-06","rank":81,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-07","rank":50,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-11-08","rank":44,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-11-09","rank":67,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-11-10","rank":24,"change":{"type":"up","amount":43}},{"date":"2026-11-11","rank":61,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-11-12","rank":70,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":30,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-11-15","rank":214,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-16","rank":108,"change":{"type":"up","amount":106}},{"date":"2026-11-17","rank":103,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-11-18","rank":103,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-19","rank":74,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-11-21","rank":138,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-22","rank":111,"change":{"type":"up","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-11-23","rank":79,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-11-24","rank":103,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-11-25","rank":74,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-11-26","rank":92,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-11-28","rank":36,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-11-04","rank":131,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-05","rank":97,"change":{"type":"up","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-11-06","rank":68,"chang